b6c276-d8fd-5138-9a90-6c09789f740d" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451138} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e7ba5258-5378-53a5-88db-6afd66703ad3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450370} {:answer/id #uuid "fc711f4a-7d29-5e54-b376-a1498498fbc2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450371}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fc711f4a-7d29-5e54-b376-a1498498fbc2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186450371} :answer-field/id #uuid "45d53e54-8c42-56fe-87b8-111b8be08363" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451139}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "7c7808ae-1f8f-5217-b026-8ee08973156b" :question/math-academy-id "q-28981" :question/problem "Which of the following statements are true in relation to the function $f(x)=(0.08)^{x}?$\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** Its range is $y>0$\n\n- **II.** It is an increasing function\n\n- **III.** $f(x)\\to 0$ as $x\\to \\infty $" :question/worked-solution "Let's start by recalling the graph of ${(0.08)}^{x}.$\n\n![](images/b4/b4e3b5119c92d02bbceb786fefd238182c7c84ca0f4abc85a19f2df86a6ba267.png)\n\nLet's go through the statements one by one.\n\n- Statement I is true. The set of possible outputs of $f(x)={(0.08)}^{x}$ consists of all the positive numbers.\n\n- Statement II is false. For $x\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ),$ the graph of $y=f(x)$ falls. Therefore, $y=f(x)$ is a decreasing function.\n\n- Statement III is true. As $x$ increases, the function value gets smaller and smaller, approaching zero. Therefore $f(x)\\to 0$ as $x\\to \\infty .$\n\nIn conclusion, only statements I and III are true."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186329831 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186110667 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ce7ef1dd-58cc-57f5-9ff9-fc997f4280ee" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying True Statements Regarding an Exponential Decay Curve"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "13c4946f-7cfd-5eea-9b2a-3c68b8c04bba" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451423} {:answer/id #uuid "631df741-fcdf-5ee9-b554-6ce847f8201f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451424}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "631df741-fcdf-5ee9-b554-6ce847f8201f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451424} :answer-field/id #uuid "9ae7393b-6d61-58de-92a9-e49a25b03a56" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186452559} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ec9a444e-8f67-59aa-984d-88ba3aa4a432" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451425} {:answer/id #uuid "c1829ff3-c9af-5728-b060-4f94a8c1209f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451426}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c1829ff3-c9af-5728-b060-4f94a8c1209f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186451426} :answer-field/id #uuid "fac9daa5-4d61-5666-831a-625724e0a0cc" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186452560} 